<section class="pillars" aria-labelledby="pillars-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="pillars__heading" id="pillars-heading">Where would you like to start?</h2>
    <div class="pillars__grid">

      <article class="pillar-card" style="--card-image: url('/assets/images/get_prepared.jpg')" aria-labelledby="pillar-get-prepared">
        <div class="pillar-card__content">
          <h3 class="pillar-card__title" id="pillar-get-prepared">Get Prepared</h3>
          <p class="pillar-card__description">Learn how to make a household emergency plan, prepare a grab bag, and protect your home before an emergency strikes.</p>
          <a class="pillar-card__link" href="/get-prepared/">Start preparing</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="pillar-card" style="--card-image: url('/assets/images/hazards.jpg')" aria-labelledby="pillar-hazards">
        <div class="pillar-card__content">
          <h3 class="pillar-card__title" id="pillar-hazards">Know Your Hazards</h3>
          <p class="pillar-card__description">Understand the hazards most likely to affect Gibraltar and know what to do before, during and after.</p>
          <a class="pillar-card__link" href="/hazards/">View all hazards</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="pillar-card" style="--card-image: url('/assets/images/community.jpg')" aria-labelledby="pillar-disabilities">
        <div class="pillar-card__content">
          <h3 class="pillar-card__title" id="pillar-disabilities">Persons with Disabilities</h3>
          <p class="pillar-card__description">Advice for persons with disabilities, people with long-term health conditions, and their carers on preparing for emergencies.</p>
          <a class="pillar-card__link" href="/persons-with-disabilities/">Read the advice</a>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="quick-actions section section--surface" aria-labelledby="actions-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="actions-heading">Five steps. Start today.</h2>
    <p class="section__intro">You don't need to prepare for everything at once. These five steps will make you and your family significantly better prepared.</p>
    <ol class="quick-actions__list">
      <li class="quick-actions__item">
        <div>
          <p>Stay informed by following the official HM Government of Gibraltar and Royal Gibraltar Police WhatsApp channels — your quickest source of updates before, during and after an incident.</p>
          <div class="quick-actions__channels">
            <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbBD0WJATRSwEP4XYu21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="whatsapp-link">
